<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: auto-turret sandbag nest -->
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.label>沙包机枪巢</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.label>
  <!-- EN: An automatic machine gun behind a ring of filled sacks. ... -->
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.description>由沙袋围成的自动机枪阵地。造价低、搭建快，但在火力下撑不了多久。可用布料或皮革建造，材料也决定它的颜色。\n它的AI不分敌我，所以请小心它的火力掩护。</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.description>
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>枪管寿命</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>无法射击: 需要替换枪管</FT_Turret_SandbagNest.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: auto-turret bunker -->
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.label>机枪碉堡</FT_Turret_Bunker.label>
  <!-- EN: An automatic machine gun inside a solid emplacement. ... -->
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.description>设在坚固工事中的自动机枪。建造费时，但非常耐打。石材与混凝土会建成砖石碉堡，金属则建成装甲碉堡。\n它的AI不分敌我，所以请小心它的火力掩护。</FT_Turret_Bunker.description>
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久</FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>枪管寿命</FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>无法射击: 需要替换枪管</FT_Turret_Bunker.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>

  
  <!-- EN: crewed machine gun bunker -->
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.label>有人机枪碉堡</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.label>
  <!-- EN: A machine gun inside a solid emplacement, worked by a colonist from inside. ... -->
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.description>由殖民者在内部操作的机枪工事。不需要电力或AI核心，因此零件比自动碉堡少，也不会误伤友军，但没有人进驻时不会开火。操作者受到工事保护，只有在又饿又累且附近没有敌人时才会出来。石材与混凝土会建成砖石碉堡，金属则建成装甲碉堡。</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.description>
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>枪管寿命</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>无法射击: 需要替换枪管</FT_Turret_GarrisonBunker.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: machine gun -->
  <FT_Gun_MG.label>机枪</FT_Gun_MG.label>
  <!-- EN: An fully automatic gun made to be mounted on a turret. -->
  <FT_Gun_MG.description>用于阵地与碉堡防御的机枪。</FT_Gun_MG.description>
  <!-- EN: machine gun -->
  <FT_Gun_MG.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>机枪</FT_Gun_MG.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Machine Gun Bunker -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.label>机枪碉堡（旧版）</FT_Turret_BunkerC.label>
  <!-- EN: A stationry turret strengthen with materials. Requires steel to refurbish its barrel after heavy use. May explode when damaged. Its dumb AI brain can't be directly controlled, so beware of friendly fire. -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.description>一种用材料加固防护的固定碉堡，大量射击后需消耗钢铁来更换砲管.损坏时可能会爆炸.它的AI不分敌我，所以请小心它的火力掩护.。</FT_Turret_BunkerC.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>枪管耐久</FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>枪管寿命</FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Cannot shoot: Needs new barrel -->
  <FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>无法射击: 需要替换枪管</FT_Turret_BunkerC.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
